(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    It’s good and does what it advertises to do but very frankly way bigger than I thought it would be. Moreover the cost is very high as the spigen one 70W does the same thing. Overall happy if you would like some quality but compactness is not upto the mark!

